            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">Disposal of special components of a ventilation system for an office building with offices, common rooms, kitchen, restaurant, auditorium and car park. The inventory is based on a building with a total heated gross floor area of 10161 m2 and a total nominal air flow of 54400 m3/h, total weight of the components: 3611 kg/Unit, building with a specific air flow rate of 5.4 m3/h per m2 heated gross floor area. Data from call of bid including stainless steel exhaust air hood for commercial kitchen and approximation für decentral fan coil units for conference rooms and offices. No ducts included.;
UUID: 8b17ff57-5831-4d59-ad25-a3e0ce1d7f7c</common:generalComment>
